WEBVTT

00:04:28.889 --> 00:04:31.142
with our beliefs about the world.

00:04:31.183 --> 00:04:33.227
So we all have different truths.

00:04:33.269 --> 00:04:35.688
They're based on things
like where we come from,

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:37.273
how we were raised

00:04:37.273 --> 00:04:39.483
and how other people perceive us.

00:04:40.693 --> 00:04:45.573
Now you and your neighbor,
who's probably a reasonable person --

00:04:45.573 --> 00:04:47.033
they look like a nice person?

00:04:47.074 --> 00:04:49.869
Yeah, they're probably
a reasonable person.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:50.911
(Laughs)

00:04:50.953 --> 00:04:53.456
You two can probably get together

00:04:53.456 --> 00:04:55.791
and come to some sort of shared agreement.

00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:58.669
But what happens when a third person
joins the conversation

00:04:58.711 --> 00:05:01.047
or a fourth or a fifth?